    "details": "Oracle reports:\n\n> The October 2026 Critical Patch Update contains 98 new security\n> patches for Oracle MySQL, 29 of which may be remotely exploitable\n> without authentication.\n>\n> The patches for MySQL Server 9.7 are contained in release 9.7.4. MySQL\n> Shell is affected through the MySQL sources it bundles and links\n> statically.\n>\n> Two further issues listed by Oracle, in the bundled curl and OpenSSL\n> copies, do not apply to these ports: they build against the curl and\n> OpenSSL of the system.\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0568",
